<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-OTERO MOVES TO BETIS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-OTERO MOVES TO BETIS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valencia said on Friday that they had sold Spanish international defender Jorge Otero to Real Betis.</p>
<p>The club gave no details of the deal.  Otero, 28, has played for Spain nine times and had been with Valencia since 1994.</p>
</text>
